# These IDs apply repo-wide, so they also cover any Dockerfile added later.
# Scoping them by path needs .trivyignore.yaml, which Trivy reads only when told
# to (--ignorefile, or ignorefile: in a Trivy config); nothing here does today.

# cli/Dockerfile (the only Dockerfile here) copies verified-binaries/tuf-cache.tgz
# with ADD on purpose: ADD unpacks a local archive itself, and the image has no
# shell step to do it otherwise. No remote URL is involved.
DS-0005

# The scanner image is a CLI that exits after each run, not a service, so a
# HEALTHCHECK has nothing to check.
DS-0026

# cosign v3.1.4 (the image's /usr/local/bin/cosign) is built with
# golang.org/x/net v0.61.0: an x/net/html denial of service, fixed in v0.62.0.
# cosign's main branch has v0.62.0 but no release does yet, and Wolfi's
# cosign-3 3.1.4-r4 still carries v0.61.0. cosign here parses no HTML. The
# entry expires so the finding comes back if no release fixes it by then.
CVE-2026-78661 exp:2026-12-15
